Hi <%= @customer.name %>,

Thanks for your order. We have received order #<%= @order.id %> and it is
currently <%= @order.status %>.

<% @items.each do |item| -%>
  <%= item.quantity %> x <%= item.product.name %> (<%= item.product.sku %>) - <%= number_to_currency(item.subtotal_cents / 100.0) %>
<% end -%>

Order total: <%= number_to_currency(@order.total_cents / 100.0) %>

We will email you again when the order ships.
